{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins when you discover a mystic ring, gaining the power to travel between two worlds! <i>Tale of Immortal Ring</i> is a top-down cultivation game that masterfully blends intense bullet-hell combat with relaxed incremental growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrust into a supernatural realm overrun by demons, you'll wield your sword against hordes of monsters\u2014each with unique forms and deadly abilities. Dodge dazzling barrages of enemy fire as you weave through chaos, cutting down entire legions of foes. Every victorious battle rewards you with precious Spirit Stones and essential crafting materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these resources to gradually restore the ring's power, unlocking incredible new abilities as you progress. Simultaneously cultivate your inner strength\u2014advancing from Qi Refining all the way to Transcending Tribulation\u2014breaking through cultivation bottlenecks one by one. Your ultimate destiny? To shatter the void itself and ascend to immortality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. Ultimate Convenience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for one-handed play with 1-2 minute sessions, delivering a relaxing, fun, and satisfying casual gaming experience perfect for short breaks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/97b72f5d9974da594f19261bb28aa317.poster.avif?t=1769248723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/97b72f5d9974da594f19261bb28aa317.webm?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/97b72f5d9974da594f19261bb28aa317.mp4?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02. Well-Designed Progression System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blends laid-back incremental gameplay with meticulously tuned mechanics, providing constant motivation and tangible feedback throughout your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/18fa589cf37d322820b1897ce045c155.poster.avif?t=1769248723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/18fa589cf37d322820b1897ce045c155.webm?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/18fa589cf37d322820b1897ce045c155.mp4?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>03. Rich and Varied Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 7 distinct themed maps, 42 carefully designed levels, and battle over 70 types of uniquely crafted monsters with smooth difficulty progression that gradually immerses you in this enchanting cultivation world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/86a2cdc1ce70a6a3ff6663c607dd12ee.poster.avif?t=1769248723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/86a2cdc1ce70a6a3ff6663c607dd12ee.webm?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/86a2cdc1ce70a6a3ff6663c607dd12ee.mp4?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>04. Deep Customization Paths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A diverse skill upgrade system spanning new ability unlocks, resource gathering efficiency, and character cultivation enhancement - allowing complete freedom to develop your personal growth strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/f6ce42bcd5d7220a355a06a5da330123.poster.avif?t=1769248723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/f6ce42bcd5d7220a355a06a5da330123.webm?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/f6ce42bcd5d7220a355a06a5da330123.mp4?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>05. Thrilling Random Elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random equipment drops inject exciting surprises into your journey, where a single lucky discovery might grant game-changing gear and the exhilaration of making an extraordinary leap toward immortality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/17bbe21e1c441eb1b5dad8fbb011bd7f.poster.avif?t=1769248723\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/17bbe21e1c441eb1b5dad8fbb011bd7f.webm?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130990/extras/17bbe21e1c441eb1b5dad8fbb011bd7f.mp4?t=1769248723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>06. Authentic Xianxia Experience</strong></p><p 